                <div class="content-container space">
                    <h4>40 % to 50 % Nickel-Iron</h4>
                    <section class="wysiwyg">
                        <p>Alloys with a Ni-content of around (40...50) wt% are characterized by a maximum in the saturation polarisation of up to JS &#61; 1.6 T and a medium range permeability. By selecting appropriate rolling and annealing conditions, the shape of the magnetization curve can be varied over a wide range.</p>

                    </section>
                    <a href="/products/soft-magnetic-materials-and-stamped-parts/40-to-50-nickel-iron" internalType="document" linktype="internal" text="40 % to 50 % Nickel-Iron" path="/products/soft-magnetic-materials-and-stamped-parts/40-to-50-nickel-iron" class="more-link" internalId="148">40 % to 50 % Nickel-Iron</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            
        
        <div class="col-md-4  col-card">
