                <div class="content-container space">
                    <h4>Soft Magnetic Stamped Parts</h4>
                    <section class="wysiwyg">
                        <p>All crystalline alloys can be processed further to stamped parts. VAC has state-of-the-art facilities for punching, deep-drawing and further processing methods like interlocking or wire-EDM.</p>

                    </section>
                    <a href="/products/soft-magnetic-materials-and-stamped-parts/soft-magnetic-stamped-parts" internalType="document" linktype="internal" text="Soft Magnetic Stamped Parts" path="/products/soft-magnetic-materials-and-stamped-parts/soft-magnetic-stamped-parts" class="more-link" internalId="143">Soft Magnetic Stamped Parts</a>
                </div>
            </div>
